      "folded": false,
      "examples": [
        {
          "exampleId": "w:consume#e-c752a84909d5c180",
          "text": "And in contrast to our increasingly networked lives where the information we consume is monitored and tracked, a printed book still offers the chance of a wholly private, “off-line” activity.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2023-ii",
            "paperTitle": "2023年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试英语（新课标Ⅱ卷）",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:reading-c",
            "locator": {
              "paragraph": 4,
              "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:reading-c:4",
              "sentence": 4
            }
          },
          "tier": "gaokao",
          "target": {
            "start": 77,
            "end": 84
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:consume#e-1461b151846df4a6",
          "text": "The answers to both questions are often “no.” The reasons relate to a variety of factors, including reduced concentration, an entertainment mindset (心态) and a tendency to multitask while consuming digital content.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2024-i",
            "paperTitle": "2024年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（新课标Ⅰ）英语试题",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2024-i:reading-c",
            "locator": {
              "paragraph": 1,
              "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2024-i:reading-c:1",
              "sentence": 3
            }
          },
          "tier": "gaokao",
          "target": {
            "start": 187,
            "end": 196
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:consume#e-e226c652f3fd887d",
          "text": "But in 2026, no such regulation exists for our polluted media landscape, which means it’s up to us, as individuals, to stop consuming AI rubbish, irritating posts, and misinformation-for-profit.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-05",
            "paperTitle": "武汉市武昌区2026届高三年级5月质量检测英语试题",
            "groupId": "group:paper-mock-hubei-wuchang-2026-05:reading-d",
            "locator": {
